
1) Judged in memory: the hook imports the lib, judges locally, and never invokes the validator
   hook, page, lib and engine read as code; the key comes through the static door

2) Only a no costs a guess
   submitGuess read branch by branch

3) The key's names: COLLEGE_GRID_PLAYER_SOURCE with validateOnly, no typed list
   search box and its source read as code; the names are held in memory

4) The copy only asks what the pool offers
   12 example claims parsed from the page and 15 prose claims, 27 judged against the 35598 row key; 2 stated facts read; 12 criteria named in the copy, each checked against the labels the 75 boards deal

5) A save from another board is not shown
   action shapes, guesses and the stale log read

6) Returning players see the rewritten rules once
   the rules flag is not 'cg-rules-seen' and storage is read inside a try

7) The Heisman unknown toast only says what is true
   "A Heisman winner on record has the same last name." checked against all 21 players it can show for

8) The board does not wait for the key
   the isLoading statement read

Negative controls

invoke) a functions.invoke of college-grid-validate planted in the hook
   fired: the hook invokes an edge function; the page must judge in memory

pagedread) the staticSource line removed from fetchCollegeGridData, so the engine would page the table
   fired: the config fetchCollegeGridData hands the engine names no staticSource, so the key would be paged out of the table again

chargeunknown) an addDailyGuess x planted in the unknown branch
   fired: the unknown branch calls addDailyGuess, so a guess the records cannot settle is charged

notfound) the no-charge early return removed
   fired: a name the key does not carry no longer returns before judging

duplicate) the no-charge early return removed
   fired: a player already on the board no longer returns before judging

acceptmissing) an addDailyGuess of an ok action planted in the missing key branch
   fired: a guess is added before the verdict (the not-found or duplicate branch charges)

typedlist) the nflCareerPlayers import planted in the search box
   fired: the search box imports the hand typed nflCareerPlayers list again

remotesearch) the old remote source planted back in collegeSearchSource
   fired: collegeSearchSource defines no local rows, so every search would go to the table

copy) "SEC Conference" planted into the guide intro
   fired: the guide entry names a retired label (a conference): " [ "Rows can be the SEC Conference.", "The College Footbal"

undealt) "1st Overall Pick", which no board deals, planted into the guide intro
   fired: the guide entry names 1st Overall Pick, which none of the 75 boards deals

oldseenkey) the rules flag set back to 'cg-rules-seen'
   fired: the rules dialog is marked seen under 'cg-rules-seen', the flag players set on the pre-611 rules, so returning players never see the new ones

heismanname) the Heisman unknown sentence set back to "A Heisman winner shares his name."
   fired: the toast says "A Heisman winner shares his name." (a winner has his folded name), which is false for 4 of 21 players it can show for: Clint Frank [Yale]; DaSha

noboardid) the board id comparison removed from the hook
   fired: no restored action is compared with the board id (staleLog)

gateboard) || !gridData planted on the isLoading line, so the board waits for the key
   fired: isLoading names gridData: the board waits for the key again

simCollegeGridPage: green. The page judges in memory, charges only a no, offers the key's names from memory, says only what the key holds, drops another board's save, loads the key through the static door and shows the board without it; all 14 of 14 controls fired.
